{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34384","headline":"袭美以巨鱼之半见分因以酬谢 · 陆龟蒙","name":"袭美以巨鱼之半见分因以酬谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁与春江上信鱼，可怜霜刃截来初。\n鳞隳似撤骚人屋，腹断疑伤远客书。\n避网几跳山影破，逆风曾蹙浪花虚。\n今朝最是家童喜，免泥荒畦掇野蔬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}